#API call for submitting answers
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/submissions/
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "answer":  "It is a prime number",
    "question_id":5,
    "owner": "Rahul"
}


### GET: Retrieve one submission
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/submissions/1/
Accept: application/json

###

### PUT: Update a submission
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/submissions/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "answer": "The number is prime",
    "question_id": 5,
    "owner": "Rahul"
}

###

### DELETE: Delete a submission
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/submissions/1/
Accept: application/json

